=start
Author: ALin
Purpose: To split merged transcripts generated by isoPropeller_merge_x.pl based on 5' and 3' ends distance.
Change log:
	v1.1	2023-09	It was modified from isoPropeller_merge_v1.5.pl.
	v1.2	2023-12 Fixed a typo in creating temp_sub_transcript_ref. Fixed an issue of getting gtf attributes. Modified to handle monoexonic and multiexonic transcripts equally. Added the outputs for new TSS and TTS bed files.
	v1.3	2024-09	Fixed the left position issue of bed.
